   {
    "rank": 2,
    "text": "20s after entering battle, immediately gain full Charge for [Dragonpact Cry], and this activation is guaranteed to trigger the instant kill effect. Thereafter, this effect triggers once every 60s. If your Perception exceeds 150, every 1 point of Perception reduces the initial and subsequent trigger intervals by 0.1s."
